    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:1",
      "title": "Episode 1",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2014-01-06T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Sterre has just started, but already faces trouble. She needs more people who will rent a part of her father's building.\n\nOn top of that, some of the people who do rent there have an argument.  Unfortunately, Sterre's father refuses to help her.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/1/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1528874
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:2",
      "title": "Episode 2",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2014-01-07T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Good news for Sterre:  someone's interested in renting workspace.\n\nThat person is Romy, but what's going on with her? Floris thinks he recognizes her from the past.\n\nHelena and Wesley try to work in the same room, but experience some difficulties. Inge knows something about Smit.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/2/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1529064
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:3",
      "title": "Episode 3",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 3,
      "number": 3,
      "released": "2014-01-08T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Thijs is working on a job for Pimp, the company of Pieter and Tom.\n\nHis mother Betsy, who also works in the building, is not happy with this.\n\nHelena's sister Eva decides to start her own company, a talent agency.\n\nFloris tries to get to know Romy better.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/3/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1529068
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:4",
      "title": "Episode 4",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 4,
      "number": 4,
      "released": "2014-01-09T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Tom speaks out his worries to Pieter.\n\nInge gets a promise from Smit, but what are the consequences?\n\nMeeting the others seems to inspire Floris.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/4/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1529645
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:5",
      "title": "Episode 5",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 5,
      "number": 5,
      "released": "2014-01-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Eva takes in Fleur as her first client, bit doesn't see through Fleur's intentions.\n\nThijs is also interested in Fleur, but on a personal level. That is one of the reasons he doesn't always like his well-meaning but  meddlesome mother being around.\n\nPieter makes a promise to Tom, but does he mean it?",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/5/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1529646
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:6",
      "title": "Episode 6",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 6,
      "number": 6,
      "released": "2014-01-13T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Inge doesn't know what to do, and confides in Wiki. Sterre feels pressure, caused by Pieter.\n\nFloris doesn't feel comfortable with his wife's surprise.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/6/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1529647
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:7",
      "title": "Episode 7",
      "season": 1,
      "episode": 7,
      "number": 7,
      "released": "2014-01-14T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Betsy fiercely campaigns internally against Pieter's and Tom's  company type. Tom goes into the counterattack.\n\nFloris feels inspired by the others, but also feels his life currently doesn't afford him to do the same.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt3355982/1/7/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 1529648
    },
    {
      "id": "tt3355982:1:8",
      "title": "Episode 8",
